                        "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                        "entry_id": "9e0671ae-af15-3949-ac68-3ddadcff6dac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Glamorous and classy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18da60bc-3fed-4b07-b26c-78ecf5f2e492",
                                "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                                "text": "That said, we're definitely going to keep our eyes peeled for some \"sliving\" merch very, very soon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7013c595-d7fc-4680-bae4-3fbe21a09945",
                                "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                                "text": "And soon cooking is about to get a lot more sliving, now that Cooking with Paris, a 6-part series, is coming to Netflix this August."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72257048-12fa-45c3-9b0e-8bc42d4d7fd6",
                                "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                                "text": "Take her famous \"sliving lasagna,\" for example. It's a family recipe, passed down from her grandmother Kathleen, \"an amazing cook.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c182275-0dbf-4462-acab-21b23b5c5172",
                                "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                                "text": "She's almost always wearing \"sliving gloves\" — lacy or bejeweled fingerless numbers she's named after a catchphrase that seems to combine \"slaying\" with \"living your best life\" — that constantly get smeared with whatever she's making."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eef6558e-687b-48a3-852a-6b0e8f32f4f7",
                                "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                                "text": "Paris Hilton's bodyguard isn't \"sliving\" even if his client is."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c13525d8-7626-42c1-8c29-5c660e8b1a17",
                                "sense_id": "583a335f-fbd3-3092-830a-bdf611ed0068",
                                "text": "Congratulatory messages flowed in from fans, many of whom deemed Nicky to be \"beautiful\" as one wrote: \"Picture perfect.\" Another said: \"Most sliving aunt out there,\" with a third adding: \"So awesome congratulations!!! That's Hott,\" and one commenting: \"Wonderful photos, you're all so graceful.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
